      "sourceText": "| 操作符  | 符号   | 作用                     | 示例                                          |\n| :--- | :--- | :--------------------- | :------------------------------------------ |\n| 可空类型 | `?`  | 声明可空变量                 | `String?` → 允许 String 或 null                |\n| 安全访问 | `?.` | 对象为 null 时跳过操作，返回 null | `user?.name` → 若 user 为 null 则返回 null       |\n| 非空断言 | `!.`  | 开发者保证变量非空（否则运行时崩溃）     | `name!.length` → 断言 name 非空                 |\n| 空合并  | `??` | 左侧为 null 时返回右侧默认值      | `name ?? \"Guest\"` → name 为 null 时返回 \"Guest\" |\n| 空合并赋值 | `??=` | 变量为 null 时才赋值 | `name ??= \"Guest\"` |",
      "translatedText": "| Operator  | Symbol   | Function                     | Example                                          |\n| :--- | :--- | :--------------------- | :------------------------------------------ |\n| Nullable type | `?`  | Declare a nullable variable                 | `String?` → Allows String or null                |\n| Safe call | `?.` | Skips the operation when the object is null and returns null | `user?.name` → Returns null if user is null       |\n| Not\\-null assertion | `!.`  | The developer guarantees that the variable is not null (otherwise it crashes at runtime)     | `name!.length` → Asserts that name is not null                 |\n| Null coalescing  | `??` | Returns the default value on the right when the left side is null      | `name ?? \"Guest\"` → Returns \"Guest\" when name is null |\n| Null coalescing assignment | `??=` | Assigns a value only when the variable is null | `name ??= \"Guest\"` |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 239,
        "outputTokens": 128,
        "costUsd": 0.000226
      }
    },
